@startuml otcp_screen_flow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 100
[*] --> Home
Home --> Search : type query
Search --> Detail : open card
Home --> Table : filters
Table --> Detail
Home --> Formats : pick format
Formats --> DeckBuilder : new deck
Detail --> DeckBuilder : add card
DeckBuilder --> Export : export
DeckBuilder --> SignIn : save / share
SignIn --> MyDecks : success
MyDecks --> DeckBuilder : load
MyDecks --> ShareLink : create / revoke
ShareLink --> ShareView : guest opens token
Home --> About : notices
note right of Home : Base /otcp/\nBrowserRouter +\n404.html fallback
@enduml
